@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 144
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam linetype ortho
top to bottom direction

title SVG Editor CLI 分层架构

rectangle "main.ts\n组合根" as Main

rectangle "CLI\nI/O 适配器 · Parser · Session" as Cli

rectangle "Core\nCommandExecutor · Receiver · Document\nHistory · Display · SVG IO" as Core

rectangle "Protocol：共享交换契约\nCommand · Shape · Result / Error\nExecutor / Receiver 端口" as Protocol

Main --> Cli
Main --> Core
Cli --> Protocol
Core --> Protocol

note bottom of Protocol
  Command 由 CLI Parser 产生，交给 Core Executor / Receiver 执行
  Protocol 提供跨层交换对象，不是独立执行层
end note

@enduml
